{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"816","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"水泥業如何減碳？ 處理器回收再利用","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">2020-03-17 13:03 台灣醒報/記者呂翔禾/台北報導</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/%E6%8E%92%E7%A2%B3-%E6%B0%B4%E6%B3%A5%E6%A5%AD.JPG\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">科學家希望透過處理器吸收二氧化碳，降低水泥業的高碳排。（Photo on Wikimedia Commons）</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px;\\\">高碳排水泥工業，要如何減碳？根據歐盟統計，水泥業是全球工業碳排量第2高的產業，比航空業還多。歐盟的實驗室研發出高溫的處理器，目前可吸收5%的碳，但科學家希望能提高到95%，讓水泥業發展碳循環經濟，並逐步研究商業化的可能，希望在2050年達成減排80%的目標。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px;\\\">根據《歐洲新聞網》報導，全球碳排放量除了汽車工業的18%外，就屬水泥業的7%最高，許多科學家都希望能讓水泥產業減少碳排。水泥工廠平均製造1噸的水泥，就會排放0.6噸的二氧化碳。這些二氧化碳過去都直接排放到大氣中，除了加劇溫室效應外，其實也是資源的浪費。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px;\\\">在歐盟的《碳捕捉計畫》資助下，科學家研發出新的處理器，利用重力原理讓水泥原物料從管子落下，管壁週圍會瞬間加熱到攝氏1000度，讓原物料將二氧化碳排出，需要的主產物從下方管子排出，利用副產物二氧化碳較輕的原理，將氣體向上排出並蒐集起來，目前這項科技已經可達到5%的回收率。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 20px;\\\">但科學家仍不滿足，希望能找到最佳吸收氣體的溫度與環境，將處理器的吸收效率提高至95%，多吸收的二氧化碳也可以作為工廠內能源需求或是其他產業用途，進而達成「循環經濟」、「碳中和（碳排出等於碳吸收）」的目的，讓水泥也可以在2050年減少80%碳排，這項科技也可以用在其他產業。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">【更多精采內容，詳見<a href=\\\"https://anntw.com/\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(138, 185, 51); text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease 0s; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer;\\\">台灣醒報</a>】</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">資料來源：https://udn.com/news/story/7266/4420664</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-03-20","clk_count":"229"}},"__N_SSG":true}